  "steps": [
    "Marinate the chicken with half the chilli powder, the turmeric, lemon juice and salt for 20 minutes.",
    "Heat the coconut oil in a heavy pan, add the fennel seeds and curry leaves and let them splutter.",
    "Add the onions and green chillies and cook on medium heat until deep golden, about 12 minutes.",
    "Add the ginger garlic paste and tomato and cook until mushy.",
    "Add the coriander powder, remaining chilli powder and half the garam masala and cook 1 minute.",
    "Add the chicken and cook covered on low heat for 20 minutes, stirring now and then, then uncover and roast until the masala is dark and coats the chicken.",
    "Finish with the pepper powder and remaining garam masala."
  ]
